     "<font face=\"Sans Serif\" size=\"4\">Hello All,</font><div><font face=\"Sans Serif\" size=\"4\">I hope this is an appropriate place to post this question, as it relates to the final product of what ctmm can provide users. This may be more of a ggplot question than ctmm, but I am thinking that other users have possibly had this issue (and solved it), so I thought it couldn&#39;t hurt to reach out and ask for some assistance, as I have been struggling to figure it out on my own. </font></div><div><font face=\"Sans Serif\" size=\"4\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"Sans Serif\" size=\"4\">I have successful created RSF odds ratio plots; however, I am struggling to combine the plots into a singular figure. </font></div><div><font face=\"Sans Serif\" size=\"4\"><br></font></div><div><b><font face=\"Sans Serif\" size=\"4\">Here is the code I have tried to utilized:</font></b></div><div><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Sans Serif&quot;;font-size:large\">ggp &lt;- ggplot(NULL, aes(df_fox1,\r\ndf_fox2, df_fox3, df_fox4, df_fox5, df_fox6)) +</span></div><div>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0in\"><font face=\"Sans Serif\" size=\"4\">geom_point(model.glm1, col = &quot;red&quot;)\r\n+</font></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0in\"><font face=\"Sans Serif\" size=\"4\">geom_point(model.glm2, col = &quot;blue&quot;)\r\n+</font></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0in\"><font face=\"Sans Serif\" size=\"4\">geom_point(model.glm3, col = &quot;green&quot;)\r\n+</font></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0in\"><font face=\"Sans Serif\" size=\"4\">geom_point(model.glm4, col = &quot;purple&quot;)\r\n+</font></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0in\"><font face=\"Sans Serif\" size=\"4\">geom_point(model.glm5, col = &quot;yellow&quot;)\r\n+</font></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0in\"><font face=\"Sans Serif\" size=\"4\">geom_point(model.glmg, col = &quot;orange&quot;)\r\n+</font></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0in\"><font face=\"Sans Serif\" size=\"4\">ggp</font></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0in\"><font face=\"Sans Serif\" size=\"4\">ggplot(ggp, aes(model.glm1, model.glm2,\r\nmodel.glm3, model.glm4, model.glm5, model.glm6) +      geom_col())</font></span></p></div><div><span style=\"background-color:transparent;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-weight:inherit;white-space:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;box-sizing:inherit\"><font face=\"Sans Serif\" size=\"4\"><br></font></span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:transparent;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;white-space:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;box-sizing:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(35,38,41)\"><b><font face=\"Sans Serif\" size=\"4\">When I run this section, I get this error: </font></b></span></span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:transparent;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-weight:inherit;white-space:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-stretc